WEBVTT

00:02.070 --> 00:03.280
What is this?

00:03.280 --> 00:05.270
Can you even call this a carriage?

00:05.270 --> 00:06.480
Goodness.

00:06.480 --> 00:09.190
I suppose this is what one should 
expect of a duke's carriage.

00:09.190 --> 00:11.690
It's like the horses are 
pulling our house behind them.

00:13.600 --> 00:15.970
Are these all of your things?

00:15.970 --> 00:19.200
If there's anything else you'd like 
carried out, please let me know.

00:19.200 --> 00:22.160
Oh, no, this is quite enough.

00:22.160 --> 00:24.440
<i>Are they trying to make me move out entirely?</i>

00:33.850 --> 00:36.380
Please take good care of my sister.

00:39.640 --> 00:41.430
<i>Rose...</i>

00:42.510 --> 00:45.740
Raeli, do take care of yourself.

02:42.760 --> 02:45.800
We have been awaiting 
your arrival, Miss McMillan.

02:45.800 --> 02:47.100
Allow me to introduce myself.

02:47.100 --> 02:52.020
I am Gideon Jura, the supervising 
butler of this mansion.

02:52.020 --> 02:55.140
It is an honor to see you again, Gideon.

02:56.010 --> 02:59.200
<i>Four butlers in one mansion?!</i>

03:00.520 --> 03:06.200
The servants will carry your things 
for you. You need not worry.

03:06.200 --> 03:08.530
I appreciate your consideration.

03:08.530 --> 03:12.070
Now, before I show you to your room,

03:12.070 --> 03:15.540
allow me to tell you 
about this mansion's history.

03:15.540 --> 03:19.180
Th-The mansion's history?

03:19.550 --> 03:20.760
Indeed.

03:21.100 --> 03:23.200
This is a venerable mansion that the

03:23.200 --> 03:26.560
Wynknight family has 
called home for centuries.

03:26.930 --> 03:31.800
It is packed full of 
the Wynknight family's history.

03:31.800 --> 03:36.070
Ah... That certainly does sound intriguing.

03:39.840 --> 03:41.190
I'm gonna die!

03:41.190 --> 03:44.920
What is this? Some new 
form of hazing?

03:44.920 --> 03:47.230
Like a "don't think 
someone like you can just

03:47.230 --> 03:50.070
come into the duke's 
mansion like that" thing?

03:50.070 --> 03:53.080
All that stuff about who they 
got the mansion from,

03:53.080 --> 03:56.580
and how every single pattern 
has immeasurable value...

03:57.330 --> 04:01.300
And how diligently 
the designer worked to design it,

04:01.300 --> 04:04.920
and how much all that work influenced 
designers who came after...

04:04.920 --> 04:07.090
I don't even care about all that!

04:07.730 --> 04:12.000
They're not going to tell me that even this 
bed is a national treasure, are they?

04:12.000 --> 04:14.700
Don't worry. That bed isn't included.

04:18.360 --> 04:19.730
Want a drink?

04:19.730 --> 04:22.570
<i>Wait a minute! How long has he been there?!</i>

04:22.940 --> 04:25.660
Wh-What are you doing here?

04:25.660 --> 04:28.360
You shouldn't just enter 
someone's room without warning!

04:28.360 --> 04:30.670
Are you saying you require privacy?

04:30.670 --> 04:32.370
Of course I do!

04:32.370 --> 04:33.720
Well, give it up.

04:33.720 --> 04:36.420
It's pointless to expect such a thing.

04:36.880 --> 04:40.450
<i>You're lucky you were born in this world.</i>

04:40.450 --> 04:43.920
<i>In my world, you would've 
been arrested long ago.</i>

04:45.240 --> 04:46.470
And?

04:46.880 --> 04:49.160
Did you have business with me?

04:50.390 --> 04:54.270
My fiancée has moved into my home.

04:54.270 --> 04:57.080
She can't just stay 
in her room all the time.

04:58.400 --> 05:00.680
<i>Yes, yes, I see.</i>

05:00.680 --> 05:04.430
The Brooks family is seeking 
monetary compensation.

05:05.400 --> 05:07.320
You have no taste in men.

05:07.320 --> 05:09.650
Yes, so it would seem.

05:09.650 --> 05:12.600
<i>After all, I proposed a deal with this guy.</i>

05:12.600 --> 05:14.830
<i>Could my taste in men be any worse?</i>

05:14.830 --> 05:18.280
I will take care of the Brooks family.

05:18.280 --> 05:21.840
You can just focus on acclimating 
yourself to life here.

05:22.240 --> 05:25.960
Your bridal training will 
begin in earnest tomorrow,

05:25.960 --> 05:27.980
but I hold no expectations for you.

05:28.800 --> 05:31.850
You needn't concern yourself with mastery.

05:32.250 --> 05:35.130
<i>Mastery? Who's worried about that?</i>

05:36.240 --> 05:41.360
Yes, I also have no intention 
of becoming your perfect bride.

05:41.360 --> 05:44.230
I wouldn't ask as much of you, either.

05:44.580 --> 05:48.280
All I need you to do is keep up 
the appearance of my fiancé.

05:50.060 --> 05:51.260
I see.

05:53.360 --> 05:55.530
I'll keep that in mind.

06:01.560 --> 06:05.230
Um... There is one thing 
I'd like to ask you.

06:07.070 --> 06:12.060
Are there any others, excluding myself, 
who know of our deal?

06:14.810 --> 06:18.060
I need to ensure 
that our stories match if so.

06:19.570 --> 06:25.560
Currently, there are only two who know 
of our deal other than you and me.

06:27.560 --> 06:30.700
One is someone you are already aware of.

06:30.700 --> 06:32.210
Master Taylor?

06:32.210 --> 06:33.560
Yes.

06:33.560 --> 06:35.060
And the other...

06:35.600 --> 06:37.450
Well, you'll know soon enough.

06:37.450 --> 06:40.740
<i>Oh... I bet he means his chief aide.</i>

06:40.740 --> 06:42.580
<i>He was in the novel, too.</i>

06:43.520 --> 06:45.800
This does mean we'll have to play the part

06:45.800 --> 06:50.090
of a harmonious couple whenever 
we're in this mansion, though.

06:50.090 --> 06:53.230
I will have you conduct yourself as my

06:53.230 --> 06:56.240
beloved fiancée both 
publicly and internally.

06:56.240 --> 06:58.710
W-Wait just a moment!

06:58.710 --> 06:59.850
What is it?

06:59.850 --> 07:01.140
Um...

07:01.620 --> 07:07.140
I believe we should discuss the more 
detailed rules that aren't in the contract.

07:07.140 --> 07:11.620
First, please address me not 
with formalities, but as "Raeliana."

07:13.640 --> 07:15.980
I will do that, Raeliana.

07:17.360 --> 07:22.300
Second, I understand that 
you have your suspicions of me,

07:22.300 --> 07:24.580
but within this room, at the very least,

07:24.580 --> 07:27.370
could you please respect my privacy?

07:29.120 --> 07:30.750
If I refuse?

07:31.380 --> 07:36.660
Even now, I act with utmost 
respect for your intentions.

07:37.220 --> 07:40.760
I simply hope you will understand that.

07:50.150 --> 07:51.520
Very well.

07:51.520 --> 07:54.560
And now, our fun must come to an end.

07:54.560 --> 07:56.280
I will take my leave.

07:56.280 --> 07:59.540
<i>Fun? How was that fun?</i>

08:00.840 --> 08:04.070
If there's anything you need, 
don't hesitate to ask.

08:04.070 --> 08:06.800
There is nothing we 
can't get for you here...

08:07.360 --> 08:08.550
Raeliana.

08:10.630 --> 08:14.100
To have you show such
 consideration for me, Duke,

08:14.100 --> 08:16.800
makes me so happy, I feel like I could cry.

08:19.600 --> 08:22.800
In that case, I won't hesitate to ask.

08:22.800 --> 08:27.240
The one thing I want right now 
is some time to myself.

08:27.240 --> 08:29.310
<i>Just get out of here!</i>

08:32.660 --> 08:37.810
If you are my fiancée, should you not 
call me "Noah" rather than "Duke,"

08:38.650 --> 08:40.830
my beloved Raeliana?

08:43.320 --> 08:45.240
<i>That's right.</i>

08:45.240 --> 08:50.370
<i>I have to play the part 
of his loving fiancée now.</i>

08:50.370 --> 08:54.130
<i>But that doesn't mean 
I can just use his first name!</i>

08:54.600 --> 08:56.030
What's the matter?

08:56.030 --> 08:58.960
If you don't like that, 
we could use pet names.

08:58.960 --> 09:03.840
No, that's quite all right. 
I'll call you by name.

09:03.840 --> 09:05.850
Say it, then.

09:08.150 --> 09:12.620
I will, the next time I need something.

09:17.960 --> 09:21.260
Words don't always come naturally 
when you need them to

09:21.260 --> 09:23.610
if you aren't accustomed to using them.

09:24.630 --> 09:26.610
Say my name right now.

09:28.610 --> 09:31.630
N-N... No...

09:31.630 --> 09:33.760
Come, now. Quickly.

09:34.530 --> 09:37.630
No...ah...

09:39.520 --> 09:41.510
Noah.

09:42.840 --> 09:44.880
<i>This jerk!</i>

09:45.680 --> 09:47.520
Well, that'll do.

09:53.530 --> 09:57.320
I will take my leave now, Raeliana.

10:02.670 --> 10:06.160
That... That... That jerk!

10:14.490 --> 10:17.230
Adam, what do you think of that girl?

10:25.700 --> 10:27.190
She's strange.

10:30.190 --> 10:33.760
<i>That's an unusually 
positive assessment for him.</i>

10:33.760 --> 10:36.560
<i>Does he actually like her?</i>

10:37.460 --> 10:39.290
"Strange," is she?

10:40.680 --> 10:42.840
Don't let her out of your sight.

10:52.400 --> 10:53.840
<i>Social etiquette.</i>

10:55.780 --> 10:56.910
<i>Embroidery.</i>

10:59.060 --> 11:00.050
<i>Dancing.</i>

11:00.750 --> 11:04.760
<i>I had no words for all 
the things they made me do</i>

11:04.760 --> 11:07.020
<i>as part of my bridal training.</i>

11:08.400 --> 11:10.440
<i>But luckily for me,</i>

11:10.440 --> 11:15.000
<i>Raeliana McMillan was someone who had 
grown up exposed to that sort of culture,</i>

11:15.000 --> 11:17.840
<i>so it all came naturally.</i>

11:18.510 --> 11:20.120
<i>The only problem is</i>

11:20.120 --> 11:23.040
<i>the differing range of education 
associated with our differing ranks.</i>

11:23.040 --> 11:26.370
<i>The McMillans are common 
nobles of the Estota class,</i>

11:27.770 --> 11:29.690
<i>and Raeliana is their daughter...</i>

11:30.620 --> 11:33.620
It's time for your math lesson.

11:33.620 --> 11:37.120
<i>But if they think I'm just another 
noble's daughter, they're very wrong!</i>

11:37.380 --> 11:40.880
<i>I was just studying 
for college entrance exams.</i>

11:41.360 --> 11:43.600
<i>I can solve these problems 
with my eyes closed.</i>

11:54.140 --> 11:57.470
It's been almost two weeks 
since I came to the duke's mansion.

12:07.450 --> 12:09.310
<i>I'm so bored.</i>

12:18.540 --> 12:21.010
You feel the need to 
wear leaves on your head?

12:21.380 --> 12:25.090
If you desire jewels, 
I'll buy you as many as you want.

12:25.090 --> 12:29.520
<i>Damn him! Why is he so utterly revolting?</i>

12:30.200 --> 12:32.480
What brings you here today?

12:34.230 --> 12:37.500
<i>A bouquet? For me?</i>

12:51.840 --> 12:54.510
<i>Absolutely revolting!</i>

12:54.510 --> 12:58.000
<i>Calm down, me. Just hold it in...</i>

13:05.550 --> 13:08.510
My people have been hailing 
you as the perfect bride,

13:08.850 --> 13:10.790
flawless and above all reproach.

13:11.520 --> 13:15.520
<i>Why is he suddenly speaking 
to me respectfully?</i>

13:15.520 --> 13:19.180
You said you had no intention 
of being my perfect bride.

13:19.180 --> 13:21.520
Why the change of heart?

13:22.250 --> 13:26.240
I-I'm simply studying to learn 
things I didn't know before.

13:26.240 --> 13:27.830
It has nothing to do with you, Duke—

13:27.830 --> 13:28.880
Noah.

13:28.880 --> 13:34.060
It... has nothing to do with you, Noah.

13:34.060 --> 13:37.040
Besides, I'm forbidden 
from leaving the mansion,

13:37.040 --> 13:40.960
so I have nothing to do 
other than focus on my studies.

13:42.250 --> 13:44.600
You're saying it's my fault?

13:44.600 --> 13:47.470
Yes, that's exactly what I'm saying.

13:47.470 --> 13:51.570
There happens to be a ball 
that I am required to attend tonight.

13:51.570 --> 13:53.460
You will accompany me there.

13:53.460 --> 13:54.600
Huh?

13:54.600 --> 13:58.470
Well, I have nothing else to do...

13:58.470 --> 14:02.480
I plan to announce my engagement there.

14:03.120 --> 14:06.480
What?! You can't just do that without—

14:06.480 --> 14:10.000
Well, the engagement 
ceremony is in one week.

14:10.000 --> 14:13.310
Engagement ceremony?! But...

14:13.310 --> 14:15.310


14:14.240 --> 14:16.280
In what world can you have 
an engagement ceremony

14:16.290 --> 14:18.360
without the engaged party's knowledge?!

14:18.360 --> 14:19.520
This world.

14:20.080 --> 14:22.300
<i>Oh, of course.</i>

14:23.410 --> 14:26.750
Well, then, I'll go get ready.

14:27.190 --> 14:28.980
No need for that.

14:31.100 --> 14:32.260
Come in.

14:33.960 --> 14:35.260
Well, well!

14:35.260 --> 14:39.020
If it isn't the young Miss McMillan!
 What an honor!

14:39.020 --> 14:42.480
My name is Nick Maddox.

14:42.480 --> 14:46.510
I am the magician who will make 
you shine at tonight's ball.

14:46.510 --> 14:48.900
Please, call me Nick.

14:48.900 --> 14:49.730
What is this?!

14:49.730 --> 14:52.020
I'll be off to get ready, as well.

14:52.020 --> 14:53.050
Hang on!

14:53.050 --> 14:56.520
Nick, take good care of my fiancée.

14:56.520 --> 14:57.670
Wait!

14:57.670 --> 15:00.640
Just leave it all to me!

15:00.640 --> 15:01.610
Well, then...

15:01.610 --> 15:06.920
I eagerly await the sight of you looking 
even more beautiful than usual, Raeliana.

15:07.610 --> 15:08.680
Noah!

15:12.410 --> 15:15.660
Oh, yes! The wonders of youth!

15:17.320 --> 15:20.060
Your skin is so pliable!

15:20.700 --> 15:22.560
But then again...

15:22.560 --> 15:25.320
Oh, dear! Honey...

15:26.570 --> 15:28.230
<i>Honey?</i>

15:29.560 --> 15:31.910
Don't worry about the little things.

15:31.910 --> 15:34.570
Just come and look at this!

15:34.570 --> 15:36.460
Those bags under your eyes!

15:41.080 --> 15:43.060
Come here.

15:43.060 --> 15:45.950
I'll cover those up nice and neat for you.

15:46.330 --> 15:49.780
<i>I have been studying all the time 
and not sleeping lately.</i>

15:49.780 --> 15:53.180
Oh, dear. Now that I look closer, 
your skin is so rough.

15:53.180 --> 15:55.640
Sleep deprivation is beauty's 
natural enemy, you know.

15:55.640 --> 16:00.630
How can you let yourself get this exhausted 
when you're about to get married?

16:00.630 --> 16:03.000
But never fear!

16:03.000 --> 16:09.560
My magic can transform any type of skin 
into smooth, silky beauty!

16:11.220 --> 16:15.120
B-By the way, um...

16:15.120 --> 16:17.260
How shall I address you?

16:17.260 --> 16:20.090
Would you prefer M-Madame?

16:20.090 --> 16:23.080
Non, non! I am Monsieur Nick.

16:27.210 --> 16:29.010
Yes! Very nice!

16:35.630 --> 16:38.520
Ta-dah! What do you think?

16:41.190 --> 16:45.060
Monsieur Nick, you're amazing!

16:45.060 --> 16:47.440
Please, just call me "Nick."

16:47.440 --> 16:51.660
Is this really my skin? I look like a doll!

16:52.470 --> 16:54.440
Do you believe me now?

16:55.280 --> 17:00.440
With my power, I will make you 
the star of the ball tonight.

17:04.870 --> 17:06.510
Nick!

17:07.040 --> 17:09.020
Mademoiselle!

17:19.000 --> 17:20.240
Wow...

17:20.240 --> 17:23.270
I can't believe I get to 
wear such a gorgeous dress.

17:24.980 --> 17:26.450
Très bien!

17:27.100 --> 17:29.440
I knew it would suit you perfectly.

17:29.440 --> 17:32.440
This is all thanks to you, Nick!

17:33.390 --> 17:35.680
All right, come sit down.

17:35.680 --> 17:37.690
I'll do your hair next.

17:39.360 --> 17:42.700
High society values 
nothing more than a smile.

17:43.030 --> 17:46.200
Two different types are popular right now.

17:46.200 --> 17:49.800
One is this: the Noah Wynknight smile.

17:50.110 --> 17:54.020
It is offered to everyone equally, 
and though it may look sincere,

17:54.020 --> 17:58.960
the true message is: "You have 
no business speaking to me."

17:59.790 --> 18:01.210
Nick...

18:01.980 --> 18:06.980
Ah, but only Noah Wynknight can pull 
that one off, so never mind.

18:06.980 --> 18:10.520
I guess I wasn't the only 
one who felt that way.

18:12.620 --> 18:15.520
Seeing the true feelings hidden

18:15.520 --> 18:18.730
behind a smile is a trivial 
matter for Monsieur Nick!

18:19.020 --> 18:22.740
And the other is the Vivian Shamal smile.

18:22.740 --> 18:25.060
Vivian Shamal?

18:25.740 --> 18:27.950
She's a real vixen.

18:27.950 --> 18:30.000
Huh? A vixen?

18:30.000 --> 18:32.870
Anyway, putting the little things aside...

18:32.870 --> 18:37.750
This is the Vivian Shamal smile.

18:38.160 --> 18:39.480
He's a pro.

18:39.480 --> 18:44.130
And finally, this is the smile 
that you will make popular.

18:44.130 --> 18:47.470
Feel free to call it the Nick Maddox smile.

18:50.150 --> 18:52.420
Go on. Do what I do.

18:52.420 --> 18:54.180
<i>Easy for him to say!</i>

18:54.180 --> 18:55.790
Non, non, non!

18:55.790 --> 18:57.770
Your eyes and mouth are too tight!

18:58.080 --> 19:01.780
Picture the face 
of the person you hate the most.

19:04.780 --> 19:09.750
However you may fight it, 
you can't escape this marriage. {ep1 final}

19:10.540 --> 19:12.130
If you saw that person again,

19:12.130 --> 19:14.540
would you shoot them 
in the head or the chest?

19:14.540 --> 19:17.040
Without a doubt, the head.

19:17.040 --> 19:20.740
Then imagine you're about 
to land that head shot!

19:20.740 --> 19:22.240
Yes, sir!

19:22.240 --> 19:24.420
Not "sir"! I'm Nick!

19:24.420 --> 19:26.050
Yes, Nick!

19:33.060 --> 19:34.560
Master Taylor.

19:36.060 --> 19:39.320
What do you think? 
I don't look strange, do I?

19:46.570 --> 19:49.240
<i>I guess I shouldn't expect him to answer me.</i>

19:49.240 --> 19:50.960
Miss McMillan...

19:51.960 --> 19:54.540
The master awaits you in his study.

19:54.540 --> 19:56.250
Allow me to escort you there.

19:56.880 --> 19:59.220
Thank you, Gideon.

19:59.710 --> 20:03.950
You look truly beautiful, Miss McMillan.

20:04.960 --> 20:06.490
You honor me.

20:08.560 --> 20:13.230
Master, the young Miss McMillan's 
preparations are complete.

20:13.230 --> 20:14.210
Enter.

20:16.230 --> 20:20.240
Wait just a moment. 
Once I finish this, we'll go—

20:23.240 --> 20:25.470
Do I look strange?

20:27.240 --> 20:29.550
<i>Why isn't he saying anything?</i>

20:29.550 --> 20:32.240
<i>I was sure he'd say something snarky again.</i>

20:55.760 --> 20:59.210
<i>I guess he doesn't even want to 
bother with flattery for me.</i>

21:01.440 --> 21:03.760
I have arranged the carriage.

21:12.180 --> 21:16.790
I'm certain he is being bashful 
because you look so beautiful.

21:17.250 --> 21:19.790
Bashful? <i>Him</i>?

21:22.290 --> 21:24.120
<i>No way.</i>

21:29.140 --> 21:32.130
Have a lovely evening, Miss McMillan.

21:32.130 --> 21:33.330
Thank you.

21:47.660 --> 21:50.470
Have a lovely evening, Lady Vivian.

22:05.150 --> 22:10.080
Noah, do you know about the two types of 
smiles that are popular in high society?

22:17.570 --> 22:19.300
<i>That's...</i>

22:20.970 --> 22:23.870
<i>the Noah Wynknight smile!</i>

23:34.970 --> 23:39.980
<b>Episode Four</b>

23:34.970 --> 23:39.980
<b>Why Raeliana Took Up the Fight</b>
